OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA generally cloudy day with
OL,6,Fshowery outbreaks throughout and a
OL,7,Frisk of thunder associated with
OL,8,Fheavier showers at times. Remaining
OL,9,Fwindy along southern exposed coastal
OL,10,Fareas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers continue overnight,
OL,13,Fsometimes heavy with a risk of thunder
OL,14,Fat times. Strong winds along the
OL,15,Fcoasts in the far southwest corner and
OL,16,Fin and around any showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
